{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5ff8b84e-6f5b-8394-bfdd-39c2d5cf34a6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T13:19:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:17:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Happy New Year's Eve almost. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I have three things. First, I just bought my house. Second, the first water and sewer bill came and it's in the former owner's name. Third, the amount is way too high for a month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that happens a lot with a new sale. The bill follows the account until the transfer goes through. Does the amount include usage from before you closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. First, I wasn't even living here. Second, I had a plumber out last week, and third, I kept the receipt. He said a toilet was running. So now they want me to pay for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a running toilet can run up the usage fast. A plumber's receipt is good to have. It's the kind of thing a supervisor looks at when they review a charge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I want a supervisor to review it. And let me ask you, so I get it right. You said the bill cannot be adjusted until the account is changed over? Was it cannot or can?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I said it can be reviewed. The adjustment is a separate step. Nothing's final until someone looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Can they call me back at 401-555-0192? I'm not paying a bill with the wrong name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 0192. I'll put the note in with your plumber receipt mentioned and have a supervisor call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
